# =============================================================================
# LOS201 – Embedded Linux Systems
#
# Keep: source code, configs, scripts, logs, reports (PDF), screenshots (PNG),
#       small kernel modules (*.ko).
# Drop: third-party source trees, kernel build artifacts, disk/kernel images,
#       initramfs archives, submission tarballs, demo video, course slides.
# Rule of thumb: nothing large or regenerable should be committed.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party source trees & toolchains (hundreds of MB, re-downloadable)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
LAB/embedded_lab1/kernel/linux-5.15/
LAB/embedded_lab1/uboot/u-boot-2022.04/
LAB/embedded_lab1/rootfs/busybox-1.35.0/

# Source archives (.tar.xz / .tar.bz2 / submission .tar.gz)
*.tar.xz
*.tar.bz2
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kernel / U-Boot / BusyBox build artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.o.*
*.a
*.mod
*.mod.c
*.cmd
modules.order
Module.symvers
.tmp_*
vmlinux
vmlinux.*
System.map
Image
zImage
uImage
*.dtb
*.dtbo
*.ko.zst

